Subject: [PATCH] fix(context): preserve scoped budget ownership through cold
 upgrades

Consolidate snotty follow-ups on the main-refreshed PR138087 owner checkpoint. Preserve original contributor ancestry, modern prepared maintenance budgets, provider-scoped early lookups, exact-producer resolved-v1, deliberate model/session caps, and error provenance. Keep cold enrichment private; no unconditional network discovery or scalar-cache source guessing. Ordered owner tests and isolated SQLite-to-cold-process proof accompany the change. Recovery branch is retained; final exact-head checks/build remain required before readiness.
